### ===================================
### Paraphrase API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/paraphrase
### ===================================

### Get Paraphrase by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/1

###

### Get Paraphrase Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/getItemDetail/1

###

### Modify Paraphrase Chinese Meaning
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/modifyMeaningChinese
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

paraphraseId=1&meaningChinese=新的中文释义

###

### ----- Paraphrase Star List Operations -----

### Create Paraphrase Star List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/save?listName=My%20Paraphrases&remark=Test%20List
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Current User's Paraphrase Star Lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/getCurrentUserList
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Update Paraphrase Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/updateById?id=1&listName=Updated%20List&remark=Updated%20Remark

###

### Delete Paraphrase Star List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/delById/1

###

### Add Paraphrase to Star List
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/putIntoStarList?paraphraseId=1&listId=1

###

### Get Paraphrase Star List Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/getListItems/20/0/1

###

### Get Review List Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/getReviewListItems/20/0/1

###

### Get Remember List Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/getRememberListItems/20/0/1

###

### Mark Paraphrase as Remembered
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/rememberOne?paraphraseId=1&listId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Keep Paraphrase in Mind
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/keepInMind?paraphraseId=1&listId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Mark Paraphrase as Forgotten
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/forgetOne?paraphraseId=1&listId=1

###

### Remove Paraphrase from Star List
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/paraphrase/star/list/removeParaphraseStar?paraphraseId=1&listId=1
